# ## 6. Residual Risks
#
# - lsp_types.oo at 251 lines (5-line margin to 256 cap); lsp_symbol_index.oo at 247 (9-line margin). Future refactor must keep these lean.
# - lsp_hover.oo at 237 (was 253) after dedupe.
# - cli/cmd_lsp.oo uses lsp_serve_buffer for file-input mode (newly added). If a future test requires in-process stream without the loop wrapper, lsp_server_process_message is the only API.
# - ooda.pkg caps=15 (CompilerReadCap counted). chs_rt_caps.c has 25+ cap grants; the "sovereign 14/15" is a curated subset, not a count of all grants.
# - The audit (2026-09-01) accepted lsp_protocol.oo as "intentional". The deep-dive reversed this per user direction. If external tooling imports lsp_protocol_*, it will break.
